@startuml
title Appendix — Stage 2 supplies local policy grounding
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam wrapWidth 225

rectangle "Synthetic policy sources" as policy
rectangle "TokenTextSplitter\nmax 20 chunks/source\nstable content-derived IDs" as chunks
rectangle "Local all-MiniLM-L6-v2\n384-dimensional embeddings" as embedding
database "PostgreSQL + pgvector\nHNSW / cosine distance" as pgvector

rectangle "CustomerSnapshot" as snapshot
rectangle "Bounded query text\n50 activities · 20 risk rows\nmax 4,000 characters" as query
rectangle "Similarity search\ntopK 3 · threshold 0.35" as search
rectangle "PolicyEvidence\nstable ID · text · metadata" as evidence
rectangle "Bounded Stage-3\nevidence envelope" as envelope

policy --> chunks
chunks --> embedding
embedding --> pgvector : store vectors
snapshot --> query
query --> embedding : embed query
embedding --> search
pgvector --> search
search --> evidence
evidence --> envelope

note bottom of evidence
Candidate grounding context only.
Not a risk score, verdict or policy truth.
Corpus and thresholds are synthetic demo choices.
end note
@enduml
